Greetings,
                                                                                
                                                                                
a short notification to interested parties that Xtables-addons 1.15
was just released some hours ago. This release is both a "minor
bugfixes" and "minor enhancements" release.

Changes include: This release adds the RAWNAT extension and fixes
subtle leftover bugs in condition, fuzzy, and ipp2p.

